---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="About Gusti Birgir Karlsson: CS student, SAR volunteer, and runner."
>
  <div class="container">
    <article class="about prose">
      <h1>About</h1>

      <p>
        I am a final-year computer science student at Háskólinn í Reykjavík (HR),
        graduating in spring 2026. My focus is full-stack web development and AI
        integration. I work primarily in TypeScript, with experience across React,
        Node.js, and cloud platforms including Azure.
      </p>

      <section>
        <h2>Search and rescue</h2>
        <p>
          I volunteer with Björgunarsveit Hafnarfjarðar, one of Iceland's rescue
          teams. This means regular training in navigation, first aid, and working
          effectively under pressure as part of a team. Call-outs happen at short
          notice and require calm, coordinated action. It has shaped the way I
          approach problems: assess the situation, communicate clearly, act.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Studies at HR</h2>
        <p>
          At Háskólinn í Reykjavík I have covered algorithms, software architecture,
          databases, machine learning, and human-computer interaction. My thesis
          project, completed in collaboration with Advania, applied multi-agent AI
          to automate executive summary generation in an enterprise setting.
        </p>
        <p>
          Outside coursework I have worked on personal and group projects spanning
          web apps, CLIs, and data pipelines. I prefer shipping something real over
          staying in tutorial land.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Running</h2>
        <p>
          I run regularly and have competed in road races in Iceland. Running gives
          me consistent headspace and a useful lesson about compounding effort over
          time. The same principle applies to building software.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          The best way to reach me is by
          <a href="mailto:agustbirgirkarlsson@gmail.com">email</a>. You can also
          find me on <a href="https://github.com/agustbirgir" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>
          and <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/agust-birgir" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about {
    padding-block: var(--space-4) var(--space-12);
  }

  .about h1 {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
  }

  .about section {
    margin-top: var(--space-8);
  }

  .about h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }
</style>
